# 60_order_by_unknown_column
# **Refused, where it used to be ignored.** An `order by` key that resolves to nothing was
# dropped by a `filter_map`, and the zip that fed it truncated every key after the first
# unresolvable one — so `order by nope, k` ordered by nothing and said so nowhere. An
# ordering the engine cannot perform is a different query from the one that was written.
REFUSED NL0509
